12
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.040
Assign the gap to the site and handling owner and state the

13
00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.300
required closure evidence.

14
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:41.300
If the proposed remedy changes the loaded configuration, revisit affected qualification and

15
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:42.200
post-move checks.

16
00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:46.960
Pause and deliver the review in three sentences: the activity requested, the

17
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:50.720
